388
00:09:28,340 --> 00:09:31,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Caffeine seekers are popping up here and there.)</font>

389
00:09:29,210 --> 00:09:30,510
<font size="64">- Is there an iced Americano? - Coffee.</font>

390
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:31,910
<font size="64">If I had coffee, I could go straight up.</font>

391
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:33,580
<font size="64">I prefer beans with some acidity.</font>

392
00:09:32,140 --> 00:09:33,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His personal preference)</font>

393
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:35,310
<font size="64">You can check it out as you go up.</font>

394
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:37,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will they be able to resist temptation and make it to the top?)</font>

395
00:09:35,310 --> 00:09:37,450
<font size="64">- The mission starts now. - Okay.</font>

396
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:40,920
<font size="64">This is way higher than it looks.</font>

397
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:41,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They start hiking their way up to the observatory.)</font>

398
00:09:41,050 --> 00:09:43,020
<font size="64">- The slope is pretty steep too. - It's steep.</font>

399
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:44,860
<font size="64">- Jong Kook seems to like it. - Yes.</font>

400
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:46,560
<font size="64">- I love it. - This is perfect, isn't it?</font>

401
00:09:46,490 --> 00:09:52,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kim Muscles loves the steep hiking trail.)</font>

402
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,730
<font size="64">- For a leg workout. - I do incline walking...</font>

403
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:50,060
<font size="64">- Okay. - on the treadmill every morning.</font>

404
00:09:50,130 --> 00:09:52,330
<font size="64">- So actual hiking is even better. - Right.</font>

405
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:54,570
<font size="64">Let's have some coffee. I want to drink coffee.</font>

406
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:55,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Already?)</font>

407
00:09:54,630 --> 00:09:56,800
<font size="64">I'm weak to the temptation of coffee.</font>

408
00:09:56,830 --> 00:09:58,940
<font size="64">Ye Eun, if there's coffee, are you going to drink it?</font>

409
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Right away)</font>

410
00:09:58,940 --> 00:09:59,940
<font size="64">Yes.</font>

411
00:09:59,940 --> 00:10:02,340
<font size="64">- We have to save up those coins. - You have to hold back.</font>

412
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:03,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Baffled)</font>

413
00:10:02,570 --> 00:10:03,940
<font size="64">- We need to save up the coins. - Don't be tempted.</font>

414
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:05,380
<font size="64">Then let's share a cup of coffee.</font>

415
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:06,640
<font size="64">That's not a bad idea.</font>

416
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:08,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Not having it is not an option.)</font>

417
00:10:06,780 --> 00:10:08,850
<font size="64">- Let's split one together. - Even if you share a cup of coffee,</font>

418
00:10:08,850 --> 00:10:10,380
<font size="64">you still lose as many coins as the people who drank it.</font>

419
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:12,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even if they share, those who eat can't get coins.)</font>

420
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:11,720
<font size="64">- Okay. - Then, we should all have our own.</font>

421
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,980
<font size="64">- Let's just drink one each. - If that's the case,</font>

422
00:10:12,980 --> 00:10:14,820
<font size="64">- we should just drink separately. - I can resist...</font>

423
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:17,050
<font size="64">pretty much any temptation.</font>

424
00:10:17,490 --> 00:10:19,290
<font size="64">I actually want to fall for a temptation.</font>

425
00:10:17,620 --> 00:10:20,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Desire-free Mr. Kim is full of confidence.)</font>

426
00:10:19,290 --> 00:10:20,420
<font size="64">That's how I feel.</font>

427
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:24,400
<font size="64">There might be a temptation to take a monorail along the way.</font>

428
00:10:21,660 --> 00:10:25,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It has already been 5 minutes since they started the hike.)</font>

429
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,760
<font size="64">- Here... - That could be the temptation.</font>

430
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:27,370
<font size="64">It's starting to get hot.</font>

431
00:10:27,370 --> 00:10:28,430
<font size="64">It's hot.</font>

432
00:10:27,930 --> 00:10:31,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Current temperature: 31°C)</font>

433
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,870
<font size="64">I hate sweating.</font>

434
00:10:32,870 --> 00:10:34,610
<font size="64">I should've worn short sleeves.</font>

435
00:10:34,610 --> 00:10:36,540
<font size="64">- I should've worn short sleeves. - I need short sleeves.</font>

436
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:38,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The drastic temperature swing has the sweat starting to pour.)</font>

437
00:10:36,770 --> 00:10:38,540
<font size="64">- Cheorwon... - There are mosquitoes.</font>

438
00:10:38,710 --> 00:10:40,210
<font size="64">I heard Cheorwon was supposed to be cool.</font>

439
00:10:40,750 --> 00:10:42,510
<font size="64">- No one knows. - Come here.</font>

440
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:44,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's hot and exhausting,)</font>

441
00:10:42,780 --> 00:10:43,950
<font size="64">Hold my arm, Ji Hyo.</font>

442
00:10:44,350 --> 00:10:47,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(with an endless uphill road.)</font>

443
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,180
<font size="64">Why is this so hard?</font>

444
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,350
<font size="64">- Ji Hyo is tired already. - I told you. It's steep.</font>

445
00:10:47,590 --> 00:10:49,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At that moment)</font>

446
00:10:49,350 --> 00:10:51,090
<font size="64">There's something over there. I see an icebox.</font>

447
00:10:51,090 --> 00:10:52,120
<font size="64">What's that?</font>

448
00:10:51,460 --> 00:10:53,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The first supply station welcomes the hikers.)</font>

449
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,220
<font size="64">It's an icebox.</font>

450
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Course 1: The first temptation)</font>

451
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,460
<font size="64">- Why? - What is it?</font>

452
00:10:55,830 --> 00:10:56,890
<font size="64">I have to drink it.</font>

453
00:10:55,930 --> 00:10:58,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(To cool off the heat in an instant,)</font>

454
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,060
<font size="64">I have to drink what's there.</font>

455
00:10:58,060 --> 00:10:59,230
<font size="64">It's water.</font>

456
00:10:58,130 --> 00:11:00,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(bone-chillingly cold water)</font>

457
00:10:59,230 --> 00:11:00,430
<font size="64">It's amazing.</font>

458
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:04,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha stops in front of the tempting cold water.)</font>

459
00:11:00,530 --> 00:11:02,970
<font size="64">- Hey, it's not that bad. - What is it, Haha?</font>

460
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:04,700
<font size="64">- What is it? - What?</font>

461
00:11:04,370 --> 00:11:06,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Coins gained in Course 1)</font>

462
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:06,300
<font size="64">- Are you really that impatient? - Is it water?</font>

463
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:07,710
<font size="64">This isn't right.</font>

464
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:10,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They skip it without hesitation to secure their coins.)</font>

465
00:11:07,710 --> 00:11:09,370
<font size="64">- It's just water. - This isn't enough.</font>

466
00:11:09,370 --> 00:11:10,640
<font size="64">- Why would you want water? - He's right.</font>

467
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:14,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They can't get the coin if they drink the water.)</font>

468
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,280
<font size="64">How many coins do we get for this?</font>

469
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,840
<font size="64">Only those who drink it fail to earn a coin.</font>

470
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,750
<font size="64">We haven't even walked that far.</font>

471
00:11:14,950 --> 00:11:17,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Frustrated)</font>

472
00:11:15,750 --> 00:11:17,310
<font size="64">How can you drink water when we've barely walked?</font>

473
00:11:17,310 --> 00:11:19,220
<font size="64">- Touch this. - Just come here.</font>

474
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:19,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It won't work.)</font>

475
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:20,650
<font size="64">Can I take this then?</font>

476
00:11:19,550 --> 00:11:21,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam chooses an R coin instead of water.)</font>

477
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,890
<font size="64">- Shouldn't we get two each? - Hey, this is...</font>

478
00:11:22,990 --> 00:11:27,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok and Jong Kook also earn one coin each.)</font>

479
00:11:23,890 --> 00:11:25,320
<font size="64">We have to go for the coffee.</font>

480
00:11:26,460 --> 00:11:27,590
<font size="64">Of course.</font>

481
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:29,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Coins gained in Course 1)</font>

482
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:29,630
<font size="64">Water isn't worth losing coins over.</font>

483
00:11:29,630 --> 00:11:31,230
<font size="64">Just come here.</font>

484
00:11:29,930 --> 00:11:32,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Hyo and Ye Eun also hold back and choose R coins.)</font>

485
00:11:31,230 --> 00:11:32,460
<font size="64">Hurry and get over here.</font>

486
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:33,860
<font size="64">- Hurry up. - This...</font>

487
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:36,070
<font size="64">- I'll let it slide this once. - Just hold back once.</font>

488
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They all resist temptation well, but...)</font>

489
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,770
<font size="64">You have to be patient.</font>

490
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Putting his hand in)</font>

491
00:11:38,940 --> 00:11:40,470
<font size="64">Hey, Yang Ssaebssaeb.</font>

492
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:41,770
<font size="64">Hurry and get over here.</font>

493
00:11:41,770 --> 00:11:43,170
<font size="64">- What are you doing? - It's nice.</font>

494
00:11:43,170 --> 00:11:45,140
<font size="64">You can't put your hand back in after touching your face.</font>

495
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:48,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mr. Monkfish saves the water for his skin and keeps the coin.)</font>

496
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:47,140
<font size="64">- What's wrong with that? - You can't put it back in.</font>

497
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,780
<font size="64">You're not going to drink this anyway.</font>

498
00:11:48,850 --> 00:11:49,980
<font size="64">Come here.</font>

499
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:51,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Warning)</font>

500
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,480
<font size="64">Just dare to drink that water.</font>

501
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:55,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Faced with a stern roar, they all pass on the water.)</font>

502
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,250
<font size="64">It must be so cool.</font>

503
00:11:55,450 --> 00:11:57,250
<font size="64">There's no point in dressing...</font>

504
00:11:55,950 --> 00:11:59,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meanwhile, the ones that headed out first...)</font>

505
00:11:57,250 --> 00:11:58,360
<font size="64">- according to the season anymore. - Jong Kook.</font>

506
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,520
<font size="64">They say I look bulky...</font>

507
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:01,060
<font size="64">when they see me from behind. What do you think?</font>

508
00:12:01,060 --> 00:12:03,160
<font size="64">- You do look bulked up. - Do I?</font>

509
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Physical 60)</font>

510
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:05,660
<font size="64">Right? Do I look bulky?</font>

511
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:08,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Without emotion)</font>

512
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:07,300
<font size="64">- Seriously, you look solid. - I do?</font>

513
00:12:07,300 --> 00:12:08,970
<font size="64">- All the hard work is paying off. - Are you proud?</font>

514
00:12:08,030 --> 00:12:09,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Proud)</font>

515
00:12:09,570 --> 00:12:11,570
<font size="64">Guys, lift heavy stuff.</font>

516
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:14,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling on top of the world thanks to the producer's flattery)</font>

517
00:12:11,570 --> 00:12:12,900
<font size="64">- Of course. - I haven't done it for long myself.</font>

518
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:14,640
<font size="64">You have to work out.</font>

519
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:15,770
<font size="64">This feels cool.</font>

520
00:12:15,770 --> 00:12:17,240
<font size="64">Of course. You should feel it.</font>

521
00:12:17,410 --> 00:12:18,480
<font size="64">Right.</font>

522
00:12:18,010 --> 00:12:20,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running)</font>

523
00:12:21,450 --> 00:12:23,580
<font size="64">I have to take first place. I should be in the lead.</font>

524
00:12:23,710 --> 00:12:25,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Adrenaline overload)</font>

525
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,120
<font size="64">I'm in first place.</font>

526
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,280
<font size="64">- Where are you going? - Okay.</font>

527
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:28,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Squeaking)</font>

528
00:12:30,050 --> 00:12:31,660
<font size="64">- Did your legs give out? - No.</font>

529
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:34,490
<font size="64">- You just ran from here to there. - No.</font>

530
00:12:33,890 --> 00:12:35,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sheepish)</font>

531
00:12:34,490 --> 00:12:35,960
<font size="64">You were like this just now.</font>

532
00:12:35,290 --> 00:12:39,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The playful senior found the perfect excuse to tease him.)</font>

533
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,100
<font size="64">- No. That's not true. - Did you sprain your ankle?</font>

534
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:39,260
<font size="64">- No. - Are you okay?</font>

535
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,360
<font size="64">Yes, I'm fine.</font>

536
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:44,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(For no reason)</font>

537
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:43,800
<font size="64">This is nice.</font>

538
00:12:44,370 --> 00:12:45,640
<font size="64">That's a lie.</font>

539
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,970
<font size="64">I remember this place.</font>

540
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,910
<font size="64">This is really steep.</font>

541
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:51,910
<font size="64">I don't usually go hiking.</font>

542
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:53,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A dizzying slope with no end in sight)</font>

543
00:12:54,850 --> 00:12:57,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok and Jong Kook are taking the lead.)</font>

544
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:56,880
<font size="64">Yu Jae Seok is going too fast.</font>

545
00:12:57,980 --> 00:13:00,850
<font size="64">- Just hurry up. - I want to walk without sweating.</font>

546
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:00,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok strides forward...)</font>

547
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:03,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(into the lead without hesitation.)</font>

548
00:13:01,190 --> 00:13:02,250
<font size="64">It's too fast.</font>

549
00:13:03,650 --> 00:13:06,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The newbie weightlifter behind him is about to run out of energy.)</font>

550
00:13:07,490 --> 00:13:08,760
<font size="64">Here's the second course.</font>

551
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,130
<font size="64">What's that?</font>

552
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Course 2, protein bar)</font>

553
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,860
<font size="64">The protein bar looks so good.</font>

554
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:14,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Protein bars for a quick energy boost)</font>

555
00:13:11,860 --> 00:13:14,130
<font size="64">You do need that kind of stuff for hiking.</font>

556
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Protein)</font>

557
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:16,070
<font size="64">It has 25 grams of protein. That's pretty nice.</font>

558
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:18,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He checks on the content.)</font>

559
00:13:16,330 --> 00:13:17,800
<font size="64">- The nutritional value is solid. - Gosh, this is...</font>

560
00:13:19,070 --> 00:13:22,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam joins in late.)</font>

561
00:13:19,070 --> 00:13:20,340
<font size="64">This is what Jong Kook likes.</font>

562
00:13:21,070 --> 00:13:22,270
<font size="64">Right?</font>

563
00:13:22,540 --> 00:13:23,640
<font size="64">Seok Jin.</font>

564
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:26,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exhausted)</font>

565
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:25,840
<font size="64">- Your face is totally sagging. - No.</font>

566
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:28,210
<font size="64">- This is a protein bar. - When did you get here?</font>

567
00:13:28,210 --> 00:13:29,710
<font size="64">- You were just down there. - No.</font>

568
00:13:29,710 --> 00:13:31,350
<font size="64">- It's not here. - Was it someone else? Sorry.</font>

569
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sorry.)</font>

570
00:13:31,820 --> 00:13:33,120
<font size="64">- I'm sorry. - What's wrong with you?</font>

571
00:13:32,550 --> 00:13:35,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's totally drained after going wild on his own.)</font>

572
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:35,020
<font size="64">You look completely out of it.</font>

573
00:13:35,890 --> 00:13:37,120
<font size="64">I'll pass on it.</font>

574
00:13:36,150 --> 00:13:38,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Grabbing)</font>

575
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:39,260
<font size="64">- But this is... - It will be really dry.</font>

576
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:40,790
<font size="64">- I want to eat it. - It will make you thirsty.</font>

577
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:42,760
<font size="64">You'd better save it and eat it later.</font>

578
00:13:41,290 --> 00:13:42,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Gulping)</font>

579
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:44,260
<font size="64">Someone's over there.</font>

580
00:13:43,290 --> 00:13:47,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just then, the slowpokes spot the leading group.)</font>

581
00:13:44,330 --> 00:13:45,700
<font size="64">They stopped over there.</font>

582
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:48,130
<font size="64">Haha, let's just eat everything like crazy.</font>

583
00:13:47,060 --> 00:13:49,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Whispering)</font>

584
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:52,140
<font size="64">- Will you eat it? - I'll just do as you say.</font>

585
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:54,040
<font size="64">You're my variety show senior, so I should learn from you.</font>

586
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,570
