<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing out loud)</font>

784
00:18:56,970 --> 00:18:58,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Ddochi and Mr. Catfish clown around...)</font>

785
00:18:57,210 --> 00:18:58,440
<font size="64">Don't you worry about me.</font>

786
00:18:59,610 --> 00:19:02,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The lead pack reaches Course 4.)</font>

787
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,640
<font size="64">This stage...</font>

788
00:19:02,010 --> 00:19:03,280
<font size="64">Is this the last stage?</font>

789
00:19:03,450 --> 00:19:04,580
<font size="64">It looks like it.</font>

790
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:06,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What will the last supply station be?)</font>

791
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:06,650
<font size="64">- Should we count... - This stage...</font>

792
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,690
<font size="64">I want an Americano.</font>

793
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:12,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's the iced Americano they wanted so much.)</font>

794
00:19:08,950 --> 00:19:10,720
<font size="64">I want a cold Americano.</font>

795
00:19:11,050 --> 00:19:12,660
<font size="64">Let's have coffee. I want coffee.</font>

796
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:14,830
<font size="64">I'm weak when it comes to coffee.</font>

797
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:16,360
<font size="64">Let's make this count.</font>

798
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:18,300
<font size="64">- How many do we have? - We need four.</font>

799
00:19:16,490 --> 00:19:19,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They immediately start to calculate the coins.)</font>

800
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:20,360
<font size="64">We get three if we don't drink this.</font>

801
00:19:19,100 --> 00:19:23,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Total coins gained: 21 out of 25)</font>

802
00:19:20,530 --> 00:19:23,430
<font size="64">- Hang on. Three... - We need twenty-five coins.</font>

803
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:24,870
<font size="64">- Jae Seok. - What?</font>

804
00:19:24,270 --> 00:19:27,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Se Chan and Ye Eun also arrive.)</font>

805
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,940
<font size="64">- Us two. - Yes.</font>

806
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:28,010
<font size="64">We're honest people.</font>

807
00:19:28,170 --> 00:19:30,370
<font size="64">Seok Jin and Kyung Hwan, honestly today...</font>

808
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:31,680
<font size="64">They need to be punished.</font>

809
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:36,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The "Let's eat whatever we want" team is still drinking their soda.)</font>

810
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,880
<font size="64">Gosh, the ice...</font>

811
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,610
<font size="64">- Well... - What? So what?</font>

812
00:19:35,910 --> 00:19:37,880
<font size="64">- What? - They're fools for skipping this.</font>

813
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:38,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Self-justification)</font>

814
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:39,420
<font size="64">- Yes. - See? There's coffee.</font>

815
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:40,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Coffee)</font>

816
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:40,480
<font size="64">He's right.</font>

817
00:19:40,550 --> 00:19:42,150
<font size="64">- How many do we have? - We need 25 coins.</font>

818
00:19:42,150 --> 00:19:44,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Heading straight forward)</font>

819
00:19:42,150 --> 00:19:43,190
<font size="64">I want one.</font>

820
00:19:43,190 --> 00:19:44,790
<font size="64">- This one... - Can we have one each?</font>

821
00:19:44,450 --> 00:19:46,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Coins gained in Course 4)</font>

822
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:47,560
<font size="64">Some of us need to skip.</font>

823
00:19:46,860 --> 00:19:49,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They currently have 21 coins.)</font>

824
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:48,860
<font size="64">- Why? - Those three had a soda.</font>

825
00:19:48,860 --> 00:19:50,260
<font size="64">Four times eight is thirty-two.</font>

826
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:52,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At least 4 of them need to get coins in order to succeed.)</font>

827
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,660
<font size="64">- Minus those three, we're at... - That's not good.</font>

828
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:53,800
<font size="64">Ye Eun, you can have one.</font>

829
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,270
<font size="64">- Go ahead. - I don't dare.</font>

830
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:58,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She refuses first.)</font>

831
00:19:55,270 --> 00:19:56,330
<font size="64">Go ahead.</font>

832
00:19:56,330 --> 00:19:57,430
<font size="64">- You're desperate. - But you...</font>

833
00:19:57,430 --> 00:19:59,100
<font size="64">- Let the desperate drink. - Take one.</font>

834
00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:00,570
<font size="64">- Let's make the show work. - Do as you're told.</font>

835
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:01,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Variety Shows Chapter 4: Do what you are told to do.)</font>

836
00:20:00,570 --> 00:20:01,640
<font size="64">Take one each.</font>

837
00:20:01,640 --> 00:20:02,910
<font size="64">- I'll obey my senior. - Yes.</font>

838
00:20:02,910 --> 00:20:03,940
<font size="64">- What about me? - You're desperate.</font>

839
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:04,980
<font size="64">- I'll drink one. - Yes, go ahead.</font>

840
00:20:04,980 --> 00:20:06,010
<font size="64">You didn't take anything so far?</font>

841
00:20:05,780 --> 00:20:08,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The variety show master and disciple decide to drink.)</font>

842
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:07,210
<font size="64">- I skipped all three. - Go.</font>

843
00:20:07,210 --> 00:20:08,610
<font size="64">- Then drink. - Go ahead.</font>

844
00:20:08,610 --> 00:20:09,710
<font size="64">You two can drink.</font>

845
00:20:10,110 --> 00:20:11,520
<font size="64">How many is it now, then?</font>

846
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:13,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Groaning gasp)</font>

847
00:20:12,650 --> 00:20:14,550
<font size="64">- Is it nice? - It's great.</font>

848
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:16,320
<font size="64">- It's tasty? - It's great!</font>

849
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:19,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A long sip)</font>

850
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:19,860
<font size="64">We need three, right?</font>

851
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:22,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A proper caffeine fix!)</font>

852
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:22,030
<font size="64">- This is insane. - Is it refreshing?</font>

853
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:24,230
<font size="64">I can feel the caffeine.</font>

854
00:20:24,530 --> 00:20:25,960
<font size="64">This is seriously good.</font>

855
00:20:25,630 --> 00:20:27,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It tastes even better after the hike.)</font>

856
00:20:26,630 --> 00:20:27,700
<font size="64">It's so sweet.</font>

857
00:20:27,530 --> 00:20:29,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While they taste paradise in a cup...)</font>

858
00:20:28,730 --> 00:20:30,970
<font size="64">Seok Jin. Speak up today. Please.</font>

859
00:20:30,970 --> 00:20:33,740
<font size="64">- Okay. - Stand up against Jae Seok.</font>

860
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:34,770
<font size="64">- Yes. - About what?</font>

861
00:20:34,570 --> 00:20:37,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They are busy encouraging the worn-out big brother.)</font>

862
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:37,740
<font size="64">You want me to take on the guy with crooked teeth?</font>

863
00:20:37,370 --> 00:20:39,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Acting tough)</font>

864
00:20:37,740 --> 00:20:40,210
<font size="64">- Yes. You should... - I'll put him in his place.</font>

865
00:20:40,210 --> 00:20:41,980
<font size="64">- Crooked Yu. - Can you guys...</font>

866
00:20:41,980 --> 00:20:43,550
<font size="64">- back me up? - You bet.</font>

867
00:20:42,110 --> 00:20:43,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They form "Seok Sam and the Subordinates.")</font>

868
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:45,720
<font size="64">To be honest,</font>

869
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:47,780
<font size="64">I think you made Jae Seok what he is now.</font>

870
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,820
<font size="64">You're not entirely wrong.</font>

871
00:20:49,820 --> 00:20:51,760
<font size="64">And he wants us to gather round at 2am?</font>

872
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:53,960
<font size="64">I hate it when you shake your leg out of anxiety...</font>

873
00:20:54,220 --> 00:20:56,130
<font size="64">- when he does that. - I wasn't anxious.</font>

874
00:20:55,530 --> 00:20:57,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Getting defensive)</font>

875
00:20:56,130 --> 00:20:57,390
<font size="64">- You were. - It's a habit of mine.</font>

876
00:20:57,390 --> 00:20:59,430
<font size="64">- "I'm anxious." - You used to...</font>

877
00:20:57,560 --> 00:20:59,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sneaking in a comment)</font>

878
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,470
<font size="64">This isn't right.</font>

879
00:21:01,470 --> 00:21:02,830
<font size="64">- No. - Now that I have backup...</font>

880
00:21:02,830 --> 00:21:04,300
<font size="64">- Don't you worry. - Okay.</font>

881
00:21:03,730 --> 00:21:07,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Junior Jee is fired up.)</font>

882
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:06,300
<font size="64">That punk...</font>

883
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:10,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He decides to rebel.)</font>

884
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:09,170
<font size="64">I'm getting more annoyed now.</font>

885
00:21:10,610 --> 00:21:13,710
<font size="64">Seok Jin. Tell him to meet you at 1am.</font>

886
00:21:11,210 --> 00:21:14,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Putting in firewood)</font>

887
00:21:13,910 --> 00:21:15,710
<font size="64">- That's a good idea. - You drank a soda?</font>

888
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:17,150
<font size="64">What did you say?</font>

889
00:21:16,410 --> 00:21:17,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Loudly)</font>

890
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:19,450
<font size="64">- Did you have a soda? - What do you care?</font>

891
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A strange habit)</font>

892
00:21:19,450 --> 00:21:20,850
<font size="64">- Yes. That's the spirit. - Good.</font>

893
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chuckling)</font>

894
00:21:21,150 --> 00:21:22,150
<font size="64">- Was that okay? - Yes.</font>

895
00:21:21,250 --> 00:21:23,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Proud)</font>

896
00:21:22,150 --> 00:21:23,150
<font size="64">That was awesome.</font>

897
00:21:23,250 --> 00:21:24,790
<font size="64">Why do you care? It's my life.</font>

898
00:21:24,790 --> 00:21:26,360
<font size="64">- Oh, good one. - "It's my life"?</font>

899
00:21:27,390 --> 00:21:29,190
<font size="64">- This won't do. Guys. - Yes?</font>

900
00:21:27,860 --> 00:21:31,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Junior Jee gets bold with his crew backing him up.)</font>

901
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,790
<font size="64">He needs a talking to.</font>

902
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:33,700
<font size="64">I'll put some sense into you. Today's the day.</font>

903
00:21:32,500 --> 00:21:34,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(But they shut their mouths in front of Jae Seok.)</font>

904
00:21:33,700 --> 00:21:34,970
<font size="64">Everyone after the seventh term, gather round.</font>

905
00:21:35,670 --> 00:21:37,400
<font size="64">- You... - "Gather round"? No, thanks.</font>

906
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,540
<font size="64">Gather round. Tenth term, what?</font>

907
00:21:38,540 --> 00:21:39,870
<font size="64">- Seventh term? - When did you join?</font>

908
00:21:39,870 --> 00:21:41,910
<font size="64">Who cares about that? How long will you drag this on?</font>

909
00:21:42,010 --> 00:21:43,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ear grab)</font>

910
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:44,840
<font size="64">I don't believe this.</font>

911
00:21:43,470 --> 00:21:45,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Senior Yu immediately restores order.)</font>

912
00:21:44,840 --> 00:21:46,240
<font size="64">- What... - How dare you?</font>

913
00:21:46,510 --> 00:21:48,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Insubordination)</font>

914
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:49,010
<font size="64">- Insubordination? - No.</font>

915
00:21:49,010 --> 00:21:50,250
<font size="64">His pinch was too weak.</font>

916
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:52,050
<font size="64">Here's some insubordination for you.</font>

917
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:54,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His grip is pitifully weak.)</font>

918
00:21:53,050 --> 00:21:54,720
<font size="64">Is this allowed?</font>

919
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:56,020
<font size="64">It's not insubordination.</font>

920
00:21:55,890 --> 00:21:57,750
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Whatever.)</font>

921
00:21:56,020 --> 00:21:57,990
<font size="64">- How many coins so far? - Let's add it up.</font>

922
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:59,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He stops Junior Jee's lesson for the mission.)</font>

923
00:21:57,990 --> 00:21:59,160
<font size="64">Let's do some counting.</font>

924
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,720
<font size="64">- How many so far? - Two more can have a coffee.</font>

925
00:22:00,120 --> 00:22:03,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(To succeed in the mission)</font>

926
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:01,830
<font size="64">- Two more? - I want one.</font>

927
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:03,060
<font size="64">- This is it. - Just two...</font>

928
00:22:03,930 --> 00:22:05,360
<font size="64">- I want one. - Just two...</font>

929
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:06,460
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - I'll have one.</font>

930
00:22:06,860 --> 00:22:09,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Junior Jee goes off on his own without consulting them.)</font>

931
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,070
<font size="64">- An iced Americano? - Wait.</font>

932
00:22:08,070 --> 00:22:09,270
<font size="64">- You had a soda. - What?</font>

933
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:10,970
<font size="64">- How many coins do you have? - I have two.</font>

934
00:22:11,230 --> 00:22:12,240
<font size="64">- Then don't drink. - Hey.</font>

935
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:13,600
<font size="64">- You had a soda too. - Come on.</font>

936
00:22:13,670 --> 00:22:16,470
<font size="64">- We need to secure the center slot. - You can't have it.</font>

937
00:22:13,770 --> 00:22:14,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mount Soi Observatory, Private room 1)</font>

938
00:22:14,770 --> 00:22:18,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's an important chance to get the middle slot.)</font>

939
00:22:16,470 --> 00:22:17,570
<font size="64">- Hey. - Yes.</font>

940
00:22:17,570 --> 00:22:19,310
<font size="64">Can't I drink what I want to?</font>

941
00:22:18,010 --> 00:22:20,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Rebellious)</font>

942
00:22:19,310 --> 00:22:20,410
<font size="64">- Seok Jin, we... - Hey.</font>

943
00:22:20,210 --> 00:22:23,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Grabbing)</font>

944
00:22:20,410 --> 00:22:21,810
<font size="64">So what if you're our senior?</font>

945
00:22:21,810 --> 00:22:22,810
<font size="64">- You're a guest. - What?</font>

946
00:22:22,810 --> 00:22:24,310
<font size="64">- Hey. - Don't you respect guests?</font>

947
00:22:23,580 --> 00:22:26,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(With Boss Jee acting up, his crew hesitantly joins in.)</font>

948
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:26,080
<font size="64">- Guys. You won't speak up? - What?</font>

949
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:27,420
<font size="64">- We need to secure the center slot. - You won't speak up?</font>

950
00:22:26,250 --> 00:22:29,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If all 3 of them drink, they will fail the mission!)</font>

951
00:22:27,420 --> 00:22:28,520
<font size="64">- Who's in the wrong? - What?</font>

952
00:22:28,520 --> 00:22:29,650
<font size="64">I feel like changing my mind.</font>

953
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:31,150
<font size="64">What got into you?</font>

954
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:35,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam acts out to get back at Senior Yu.)</font>

955
00:22:31,150 --> 00:22:32,620
<font size="64">- To be honest... - Yes.</font>

956
00:22:32,620 --> 00:22:35,190
<font size="64">I decided on a new motto when we started the hike.</font>

957
00:22:35,390 --> 00:22:37,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Rebellion is quelled.)</font>

958
00:22:36,730 --> 00:22:38,030
<font size="64">- He took a sip. - He drank mine.</font>

959
00:22:37,030 --> 00:22:39,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Jin uses 1 coin.)</font>

960
00:22:39,060 --> 00:22:40,830
<font size="64">- Seok Jin, you don't get a coin. - Why not?</font>

961
00:22:40,830 --> 00:22:42,630
<font size="64">- That's not fair. - Give it back.</font>

962
00:22:41,530 --> 00:22:43,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Why now?)</font>

963
00:22:42,630 --> 00:22:44,370
<font size="64">You enjoyed it. You took a long sip.</font>

964
00:22:44,370 --> 00:22:46,040
<font size="64">This is a mission.</font>

965
00:22:46,270 --> 00:22:47,740
<font size="64">We need to succeed.</font>

966
00:22:46,570 --> 00:22:48,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Absurd)</font>

967
00:22:47,740 --> 00:22:49,540
<font size="64">Let's eat what we want. That's my motto.</font>

968
00:22:49,540 --> 00:22:50,940
<font size="64">- Sure. - That's all good.</font>

969
00:22:51,110 --> 00:22:52,340
<font size="64">- This... - Eat what you want,</font>

970
00:22:52,340 --> 00:22:53,780
<font size="64">and depart this world first.</font>

971
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:56,050
<font size="64">- That's fine. - Why would you curse me like that?</font>

972
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:57,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Choking up)</font>

973
00:22:56,050 --> 00:22:57,050
<font size="64">Telling me to die.</font>

974
00:22:57,050 --> 00:22:58,780
<font size="64">- How is that a curse? - It is.</font>

975
00:22:58,780 --> 00:22:59,980
<font size="64">- I'm looking out for you. - It's not?</font>

976
00:23:00,150 --> 00:23:01,420
<font size="64">You can't eat everything you want.</font>

977
00:23:01,420 --> 00:23:03,020
<font size="64">You only look out for me at times like this!</font>

978
00:23:03,390 --> 00:23:05,890
<font size="64">I'm older, so cancel the 2am summon.</font>

979
00:23:06,590 --> 00:23:07,720
<font size="64">- The 2am... - Don't fight.</font>

980
00:23:06,690 --> 00:23:07,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

981
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,290
<font size="64">- Cancel it. - The summon...</font>

982
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:10,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He must have felt bad...)</font>

983
00:23:09,290 --> 00:23:10,890
<font size="64">- That's your demand? - Don't demand he cancel.</font>

984
00:23:10,890 --> 00:23:12,530
<font size="64">- Just don't show up. - That's it?</font>

985
00:23:12,530 --> 00:23:13,630
<font size="64">- Don't go. - You were...</font>

986
00:23:13,630 --> 00:23:14,730
<font size="64">stressed out all this while.</font>

987
00:23:14,870 --> 00:23:16,430
<font size="64">- Okay. It's canceled. - It's off.</font>

988
00:23:16,430 --> 00:23:17,470
<font size="64">I'll call it off.</font>

989
00:23:17,070 --> 00:23:19,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He officially cancels the 2am summon.)</font>

990
00:23:17,570 --> 00:23:20,070
<font size="64">I think we should let Seok Jin do whatever he wants today.</font>

991
00:23:19,270 --> 00:23:21,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Starting again)</font>

992
00:23:20,070 --> 00:23:21,070
<font size="64">- Let him eat. - Yes.</font>

993
00:23:21,140 --> 00:23:23,740
<font size="64">- Let us live and do what we want. - Seriously.</font>

994
00:23:23,970 --> 00:23:25,740
<font size="64">- We need 25 coins. - Yes.</font>

995
00:23:24,140 --> 00:23:25,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Total coins gained: 21 out of 25)</font>

996
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:28,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They will succeed if 4 of them can hold out a little longer.)</font>

997
00:23:25,740 --> 00:23:27,610
<font size="64">You have 2? There's 1 more stage.</font>

998
00:23:27,710 --> 00:23:28,780
<font size="64">- One more to go. - Just don't.</font>

999
00:23:28,780 --> 00:23:29,780
<font size="64">- Hey. - What?</font>

1000
00:23:29,180 --> 00:23:30,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At that moment...)</font>

1001
00:23:30,650 --> 00:23:33,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A car suddenly barges in.)</font>

1002
00:23:30,810 --> 00:23:32,250
<font size="64">Hey, this is...</font>

1003
00:23:32,350 --> 00:23:33,350
<font size="64">What's this?</font>

1004
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:36,090
<font size="64">- What's that? - We have iced water...</font>

1005
00:23:36,090 --> 00:23:37,720
<font size="64">- and air conditioning. - We get a lift?</font>

1006
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Iced water, air conditioning, and a ride to the top)</font>

1007
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,760
<font size="64">You can get in.</font>

1008
00:23:38,760 --> 00:23:39,820
<font size="64">For how many coins?</font>

1009
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:40,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tempted)</font>

1010
00:23:40,120 --> 00:23:41,260
<font size="64">This is crazy.</font>

1011
00:23:41,060 --> 00:23:43,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running forward)</font>

1012
00:23:41,660 --> 00:23:42,890
<font size="64">For how many coins?</font>

1013
00:23:43,330 --> 00:23:44,730
<font size="64">- What are you doing? - What?</font>

1014
00:23:43,360 --> 00:23:45,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The ultimate temptation came at the very end.)</font>

1015
00:23:44,730 --> 00:23:45,800
<font size="64">- Come on. - Seok Jin.</font>

1016
00:23:45,730 --> 00:23:48,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam is already wavering.)</font>

1017
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:47,700
<font size="64">- What? - What are you doing?</font>

1018
00:23:48,100 --> 00:23:49,170
<font size="64">How many coins for a ride?</font>

1019
00:23:49,170 --> 00:23:50,530
<font size="64">You can get in for just one coin.</font>

1020
00:23:49,330 --> 00:23:52,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They can get in for 1 coin.)</font>

1021
00:23:50,530 --> 00:23:52,800
<font size="64">- Just one? - There's AC and iced water.</font>

1022
00:23:52,800 --> 00:23:54,540
<font size="64">- We need this slot. - Haha.</font>

1023
00:23:53,170 --> 00:23:56,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's hard to resist, due to the heat and uphill climb.)</font>

1024
00:23:54,540 --> 00:23:55,770
<font size="64">- Hey. - Why you...</font>

1025
00:23:55,770 --> 00:23:57,240
<font size="64">I feel rotten now.</font>

1026
00:23:57,340 --> 00:23:59,040
<font size="64">- Power! - Speed!</font>

1027
00:23:58,180 --> 00:24:00,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Power and Speed are about to get in.)</font>

1028
00:23:59,040 --> 00:24:00,080
<font size="64">- Cross! - Cross!</font>

1029
00:24:00,080 --> 00:24:01,240
<font size="64">Don't you dare get in.</font>

1030
00:24:01,610 --> 00:24:03,450
<font size="64">Get in and watch what happens for the rest of the day.</font>

1031
00:24:03,450 --> 00:24:04,510
<font size="64">Who do you think you are?</font>

1032
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:06,380
<font size="64">- You... - You were so cool just now.</font>

1033
00:24:06,380 --> 00:24:08,350
<font size="64">Right? Wasn't I cool?</font>

1034
00:24:06,650 --> 00:24:08,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Proud)</font>

1035
00:24:09,090 --> 00:24:11,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Luring with iced water)</font>

1036
00:24:09,620 --> 00:24:10,920
<font size="64">Go. Get in.</font>

1037
00:24:11,620 --> 00:24:12,890
<font size="64">Let's play rock-paper-scissors and get in.</font>

1038
00:24:12,890 --> 00:24:14,720
<font size="64">- Let's take the car. For two... - Three here...</font>

1039
00:24:14,830 --> 00:24:16,290
<font size="64">We don't know what's at the top.</font>

1040
00:24:15,130 --> 00:24:18,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They will fail the mission if they both use their coins.)</font>

1041
00:24:16,290 --> 00:24:17,360
<font size="64">Right. We should save up.</font>

1042
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:18,960
<font size="64">Why do we have to...</font>

1043
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,260
<font size="64">- coddle them? - Right.</font>

1044
00:24:20,460 --> 00:24:22,200
<font size="64">- Why should we... - Just three people...</font>

1045
00:24:22,300 --> 00:24:24,330
<font size="64">You're old enough to know reason.</font>

1046
00:24:22,870 --> 00:24:24,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(This is irritating.)</font>

1047
00:24:24,370 --> 00:24:25,670
<font size="64">- Why should we... - Yes.</font>

1048
00:24:25,670 --> 00:24:27,470
<font size="64">Let's dump him when he's of no use to us.</font>

1049
00:24:27,470 --> 00:24:28,940
<font size="64">- Shall we do that? - Punish him then.</font>

1050
00:24:29,110 --> 00:24:30,510
<font size="64">- Then... - Show him how we feel.</font>

1051
00:24:30,510 --> 00:24:31,680
<font size="64">- For now... - Hang on.</font>

1052
00:24:30,670 --> 00:24:33,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A chilling warning of exclusion)</font>

1053
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,980
<font size="64">- You'll exile him later? - Yes.</font>

1054
00:24:33,310 --> 00:24:34,950
<font size="64">- You'll get left behind. - At the top...</font>

1055
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,910
<font size="64">No one's taking the car?</font>

1056
00:24:36,380 --> 00:24:37,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The hand of temptation)</font>

1057
00:24:37,410 --> 00:24:38,720
<font size="64">- No. - No takers?</font>

1058
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,920
<font size="64">- Well... - No.</font>

1059
00:24:39,080 --> 00:24:40,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stern)</font>

1060
00:24:40,320 --> 00:24:42,220
<font size="64">- Let's keep climbing. - Let's go.</font>

1061
00:24:40,950 --> 00:24:42,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He takes some coffee first.)</font>

1062
00:24:42,220 --> 00:24:43,720
<font size="64">- Let's go. - Let's press on.</font>

1063
00:24:43,820 --> 00:24:45,760
<font size="64">- I want a ride. - Let's go.</font>

1064
00:24:45,760 --> 00:24:47,290
<font size="64">- You're allowed. - There's one stage left, right?</font>

1065
00:24:47,290 --> 00:24:49,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Reading the room)</font>

1066
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:49,060
<font size="64">Come on now.</font>

1067
00:24:49,490 --> 00:24:51,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The two are constantly looking for a chance to spend their coins.)</font>

1068
00:24:49,690 --> 00:24:51,130
<font size="64">Help out the guest.</font>

1069
00:24:51,330 --> 00:24:53,600
<font size="64">This isn't a group mission. We're fending for ourselves.</font>

1070
00:24:51,560 --> 00:24:54,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They will fail if both get in the car.)</font>

1071
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:58,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The lead pack walks on, totally clueless.)</font>

1072
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:57,970
<font size="64">If it's cup noodles, I'll go for it.</font>

1073
00:24:58,640 --> 00:25:00,100
<font size="64">I haven't been here in a long time.</font>

1074
00:25:01,070 --> 00:25:02,210
<font size="64">Mount Soi Observatory.</font>

1075
00:25:03,510 --> 00:25:04,880
<font size="64">This used to be a US Army barracks.</font>

1076
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:06,580
<font size="64">- What? - The building to your right.</font>

1077
00:25:05,580 --> 00:25:09,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A Korean War US radar base)</font>

1078
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:07,880
<font size="64">- Oh, this one? - Yes.</font>

1079
00:25:08,910 --> 00:25:11,750
<font size="64">I came here before you did.</font>

1080
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:15,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He shows off, since he has experience with Mount Soi.)</font>

1081
00:25:13,380 --> 00:25:15,350
<font size="64">- You already know? Okay. - Yes.</font>

1082
00:25:16,590 --> 00:25:17,790
<font size="64">There's a staircase?</font>

1083
00:25:18,890 --> 00:25:21,520
<font size="64">I can't quit soccer even though I struggle during Running Man.</font>

1084
00:25:22,390 --> 00:25:25,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(These stairs pose a threat even to Kim Muscles.)</font>

1085
00:25:25,530 --> 00:25:30,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The man with lean muscles leads the group in the climb.)</font>

1086
00:25:27,860 --> 00:25:29,570
<font size="64">I should've worn a short-sleeved shirt.</font>

1087
00:25:31,740 --> 00:25:32,740
<font size="64">Hello.</font>

1088
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:35,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A sweaty 40-minute climb without a break)</font>

1089
00:25:35,340 --> 00:25:36,340
<font size="64">What's this?</font>

1090
00:25:37,040 --> 00:25:38,880
<font size="64">Welcome to the peak.</font>

1091
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:41,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He finally arrived at the top.)</font>

1092
00:25:39,710 --> 00:25:41,980
<font size="64">- Put your coins in the box. - Okay.</font>

1093
00:25:42,050 --> 00:25:44,080
<font size="64">You made it to the top on foot,</font>

1094
00:25:44,080 --> 00:25:46,180
<font size="64">so you get the Cheorwon specialty, Rushmelon.</font>

1095
00:25:44,380 --> 00:25:45,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(To celebrate finishing the hike,)</font>

1096
00:25:45,850 --> 00:25:48,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they are given Cheorwon's specialty, Rushmellow.)</font>

1097
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:48,820
<font size="64">I want this so much.</font>

1098
00:25:50,150 --> 00:25:53,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A cold and sweet piece of melon to chase away the sweat)</font>

1099
00:25:54,790 --> 00:25:57,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kook is the next to arrive.)</font>

1100
00:25:57,830 --> 00:25:58,830
<font size="64">It's so good.</font>

1101
00:25:58,830 --> 00:26:00,360
<font size="64">- It's so good. - Oh, mangoes.</font>

1102
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:03,430
<font size="64">- Melons. - Melons? Right, melons.</font>

1103
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:08,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He takes the free food, totally wiped out.)</font>

1104
00:26:04,130 --> 00:26:05,540
<font size="64">- This is for free? - Yes.</font>

1105
00:26:05,970 --> 00:26:06,970
<font size="64">For real?</font>

1106
00:26:07,740 --> 00:26:10,110
<font size="64">Are you serious? We get a treat?</font>

1107
00:26:10,870 --> 00:26:15,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They reach the peak one by one.)</font>

1108
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:13,440
<font size="64">Wait. Is this a gift?</font>

1109
00:26:14,950 --> 00:26:17,510
<font size="64">- I want a ride. - Let's be honest.</font>

1110
00:26:15,180 --> 00:26:18,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(These two are still fighting in front of the car.)</font>

1111
00:26:18,080 --> 00:26:19,550
<font size="64">I come on the show once a year.</font>

1112
00:26:19,850 --> 00:26:21,790
<font size="64">I'm getting in. Let's hitch a ride together.</font>

1113
00:26:21,890 --> 00:26:23,350
<font size="64">There must be something else.</font>

1114
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:22,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Total coins gained: 24 out of 25)</font>

1115
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:26,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They will fail the mission once two of them get in.)</font>

1116
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:25,390
<font size="64">But what... Why?</font>

1117
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:26,960
<font size="64">Let's get in.</font>

1118
00:26:28,220 --> 00:26:29,690
<font size="64">Put your hand right here.</font>

1119
00:26:30,930 --> 00:26:33,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming about the cool air)</font>

1120
00:26:33,100 --> 00:26:34,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Groaning)</font>

1121
00:26:34,970 --> 00:26:37,300
<font size="64">Shouldn't you get out to talk to us?</font>

1122
00:26:37,630 --> 00:26:39,140
<font size="64">Why is he staying inside?</font>

1123
00:26:38,470 --> 00:26:42,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Displeased at the lack of effort)</font>

1124
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:41,400
<font size="64">You're taking the easy route.</font>

1125
00:26:42,210 --> 00:26:45,640
<font size="64">This is the center slot of the board.</font>

1126
00:26:44,170 --> 00:26:47,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mount Soi Observatory, Private room 1)</font>

1127
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:47,410
<font size="64">- That's why... - It's a tough choice.</font>

1128
00:26:47,910 --> 00:26:50,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(In great anguish)</font>

1129
00:26:51,110 --> 00:26:52,480
<font size="64">I don't fear getting yelled at.</font>

1130
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:55,090
<font size="64">- But I fear losing the center... - This is insane.</font>

1131
00:26:55,090 --> 00:26:56,890
<font size="64">and ending up not eating lunch.</font>

1132
00:26:57,450 --> 00:26:59,760
<font size="64">I'll walk up. You hitch a ride...</font>

1133
00:27:00,320 --> 00:27:01,830
<font size="64">and show us how great you are.</font>

1134
00:27:02,690 --> 00:27:03,890
<font size="64">- I can... - I want to...</font>

1135
00:27:03,890 --> 00:27:06,130
<font size="64">- retaliate a bit. - Yes. You retaliate.</font>

1136
00:27:06,530 --> 00:27:08,370
<font size="64">Kyung Hwan isn't here yet?</font>

1137
00:27:08,630 --> 00:27:11,100
<font size="64">Haha's the problem. He's a troublemaker.</font>

1138
00:27:08,870 --> 00:27:11,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They will fail the mission if both of them got in the car.)</font>

1139
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,900
<font size="64">Haha's the problem.</font>

1140
00:27:11,630 --> 00:27:13,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Did they ride the car?)</font>

1141
00:27:13,540 --> 00:27:14,970
<font size="64">- What are you eating? - He's here.</font>

1142
00:27:13,870 --> 00:27:15,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(At that moment)</font>

1143
00:27:14,970 --> 00:27:16,140
<font size="64">He's here.</font>

1144
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:16,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kyung Hwan walked up...)</font>

1145
00:27:16,710 --> 00:27:18,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(and so did Haha!)</font>

1146
00:27:17,910 --> 00:27:18,940
<font size="64">It's beautiful.</font>

1147
00:27:18,940 --> 00:27:19,980
<font size="64">Yes. You retaliate.</font>

1148
00:27:19,810 --> 00:27:22,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After a long squabble)</font>

1149
00:27:20,980 --> 00:27:22,380
<font size="64">- Enjoy the ride. - It's annoying.</font>

1150
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:23,510
<font size="64">I'll walk fast.</font>

1151
00:27:24,150 --> 00:27:26,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kyung Hwan gave up the ride.)</font>

1152
00:27:25,650 --> 00:27:26,850
<font size="64">Where are you going?</font>

1153
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:29,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha follows because he doesn't want to get yelled at alone.)</font>

1154
00:27:29,990 --> 00:27:31,760
<font size="64">- Hand over your coins. - I did.</font>

1155
00:27:30,250 --> 00:27:33,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And so, they got 2 extra coins.)</font>

1156
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:33,520
<font size="64">You collected...</font>

1157
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,590
<font size="64">a total of 26 coins, so this mission is a success.</font>

1158
00:27:35,590 --> 00:27:37,160
<font size="64">- Okay! - Okay.</font>

1159
00:27:37,160 --> 00:27:39,230
<font size="64">Do you see the golden yellow field?</font>

1160
00:27:39,230 --> 00:27:41,300
<font size="64">- Gosh. - Gosh.</font>

1161
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:43,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Below Mount Soi's summit,)</font>

1162
00:27:41,930 --> 00:27:43,730
<font size="64">- No way. - No way.</font>

1163
00:27:43,730 --> 00:27:47,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(they can see a panoramic autumn view of Cheorwon.)</font>

1164
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,700
<font size="64">It's so pretty.</font>

1165
00:27:46,170 --> 00:27:47,700
<font size="64">It's been a while since I visited such a place.</font>

1166
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:49,840
<font size="64">It's so nice up here.</font>

1167
00:27:48,870 --> 00:27:52,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The tough climb was totally worth it.)</font>

1168
00:27:50,140 --> 00:27:52,210
<font size="64">It's just fantastic.</font>

1169
00:27:52,210 --> 00:27:54,010
<font size="64">You cleared this mission.</font>

1170
00:27:54,180 --> 00:27:56,450
<font size="64">Peel off the sticker that says "Mount Soi Observatory."</font>

1171
00:27:56,450 --> 00:27:58,010
<font size="64">- Okay. - We get something.</font>

1172
00:27:56,950 --> 00:28:00,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They open the bingo slot.)</font>

1173
00:27:58,010 --> 00:27:59,120
<font size="64">- The private room. - The center slot...</font>

1174
00:27:59,120 --> 00:28:00,650
<font size="64">- is important. - A private room is great.</font>

1175
00:28:00,650 --> 00:28:01,920
<font size="64">- We won? - We got it?</font>

1176
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:03,090
<font size="64">- Oh, dear. - What's this?</font>

1177
00:28:03,220 --> 00:28:04,490
<font size="64">- What's this? - It's Seok Jin's?</font>

1178
00:28:04,490 --> 00:28:05,860
<font size="64">He gets locked up in a private room?</font>

1179
00:28:06,260 --> 00:28:07,920
<font size="64">Seok Jin is the hidden member...</font>

1180
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:09,630
<font size="64">- of Mount Soi Observatory. - What now?</font>

1181
00:28:09,730 --> 00:28:12,100
<font size="64">- It means Seok Jin gets a penalty. - What?</font>

1182
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,330
<font size="64">A penalty?</font>

1183
00:28:13,530 --> 00:28:14,630
<font size="64">That's a bad thing, then.</font>

1184
00:28:14,100 --> 00:28:15,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Clapping)</font>

1185
00:28:14,630 --> 00:28:15,730
<font size="64">What?</font>

1186
00:28:15,930 --> 00:28:16,970
<font size="64">- For doing nothing? - A penalty?</font>

1187
00:28:16,570 --> 00:28:19,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Speechless)</font>

1188
00:28:16,970 --> 00:28:19,840
<font size="64">- What did he do wrong? - Think about it.</font>

1189
00:28:19,840 --> 00:28:21,400
<font size="64">What did he do wrong?</font>

1190
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,910
<font size="64">Why should anyone be penalized?</font>

1191
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:25,280
<font size="64">- Why... - What are you up to?</font>

1192
00:28:24,370 --> 00:28:27,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Outraged to hear about the penalty after succeeding in the mission)</font>

1193
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:27,110
<font size="64">Filming crew. What are you thinking?</font>

1194
00:28:27,310 --> 00:28:28,750
<font size="64">- I love it. - Yes.</font>

1195
00:28:29,050 --> 00:28:30,550
<font size="64">Isn't this great?</font>

1196
00:28:29,650 --> 00:28:32,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Senior Yu is excited to hear about Seok Sam's penalty.)</font>

1197
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:32,520
<font size="64">He deserves a penalty.</font>

1198
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:35,090
<font size="64">He always manages to escape getting penalized.</font>

1199
00:28:33,820 --> 00:28:35,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(For 6 weeks in a row)</font>

1200
00:28:35,090 --> 00:28:37,550
<font size="64">He acted extra weird the whole climb.</font>

1201
00:28:37,550 --> 00:28:38,620
<font size="64">What's the penalty?</font>

1202
00:28:38,620 --> 00:28:40,520
<font size="64">- What's the reason? - Having a room is always nice.</font>

1203
00:28:40,520 --> 00:28:42,930
<font size="64">Just like Seok Jin, who just got a penalty,</font>

1204
00:28:41,490 --> 00:28:43,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(How we choose who gets today's penalty)</font>

1205
00:28:42,930 --> 00:28:44,890
<font size="64">the member whose face is shown...</font>

1206
00:28:44,890 --> 00:28:47,960
<font size="64">will receive a penalty, whether or not you pass the mission.</font>

1207
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:50,700
<font size="64">A total of three members will get a penalty,</font>

1208
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:54,270
<font size="64">chosen by drawing lots from those...</font>

1209
00:28:51,670 --> 00:28:54,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If 4 or more faces are revealed because of a failed bingo,)</font>

1210
00:28:54,270 --> 00:28:56,840
<font size="64">who had their faces revealed.</font>

1211
00:28:54,370 --> 00:28:56,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(3 of them will be selected to receive the penalty.)</font>

1212
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:58,370
<font size="64">- Hold on. - It's not settled yet.</font>

1213
00:28:58,370 --> 00:29:00,440
<font size="64">- Nothing's settled yet. - Hang on a second.</font>

1214
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,910
<font size="64">During the meeting, you already decided...</font>

1215
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(When the production team was in a meeting)</font>

1216
00:29:01,910 --> 00:29:03,350
<font size="64">that I was going to receive a penalty.</font>

1217
00:29:03,350 --> 00:29:04,680
<font size="64">- No way. - Everyone always goes...</font>

1218
00:29:03,680 --> 00:29:06,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Upset)</font>

1219
00:29:04,680 --> 00:29:06,620
<font size="64">for the center bingo square.</font>

1220
00:29:06,620 --> 00:29:08,150
<font size="64">- Wait. - This is bingo.</font>

1221
00:29:07,150 --> 00:29:09,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The prime spot everyone fights for in bingo)</font>

1222
00:29:08,150 --> 00:29:09,920
<font size="64">Even a fool goes for that square.</font>

1223
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:11,420
<font size="64">- That's true. - We could've failed the mission.</font>

1224
00:29:11,420 --> 00:29:12,520
<font size="64">If it were these squares... What?</font>

1225
00:29:12,220 --> 00:29:14,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If 4 or more squares are revealed due to a failed mission,)</font>

1226
00:29:12,520 --> 00:29:14,290
<font size="64">- We could've failed the mission. - We almost failed.</font>

1227
00:29:14,290 --> 00:29:16,560
<font size="64">- We barely made it this round. - Exactly.</font>

1228
00:29:14,290 --> 00:29:16,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(his penalty may be waived.)</font>

1229
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:18,330
<font size="64">As if they'd let us fail the mission for the center square.</font>

1230
00:29:16,760 --> 00:29:19,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's upset that he's in the center.)</font>

1231
00:29:18,330 --> 00:29:19,830
<font size="64">Just so you know, it was Director Kang Chan Hee...</font>

1232
00:29:19,830 --> 00:29:21,330
<font size="64">who assigned the squares.</font>

1233
00:29:21,330 --> 00:29:23,300
<font size="64">- Hold on. - Chan Hee's older than you.</font>

1234
00:29:23,330 --> 00:29:25,100
<font size="64">Chan Hee, are you kidding me?</font>

1235
00:29:25,370 --> 00:29:28,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(In advance, Chan Hee decided who went in the center.)</font>

1236
00:29:27,100 --> 00:29:30,810
<font size="64">Seok Jin's a guy we can rely on and he's the oldest,</font>

1237
00:29:30,810 --> 00:29:31,840
<font size="64">so he goes in the center.</font>

1238
00:29:30,840 --> 00:29:34,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Placed in the middle hoping he'd take the penalty in stride)</font>

1239
00:29:33,010 --> 00:29:34,440
<font size="64">Chan Hee, are you kidding me?</font>

1240
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:36,210
<font size="64">Wait. Chan Hee didn't come up all the way here.</font>

1241
00:29:36,210 --> 00:29:37,880
<font size="64">He didn't join us. He's still at the bottom.</font>

1242
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,280
<font size="64">He stayed where we started.</font>

1243
00:29:39,280 --> 00:29:41,220
<font size="64">- Chan Hee's unbelievable. - That's a 30-year veteran for you.</font>

1244
00:29:40,050 --> 00:29:42,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He will raise his objections after coming back down.)</font>

1245
00:29:41,220 --> 00:29:43,290
<font size="64">You completed the mission at Mount Soi Observatory.</font>

1246
00:29:43,290 --> 00:29:45,420
<font size="64">Please go ahead and choose the next square.</font>

1247
00:29:43,690 --> 00:29:46,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He chooses the next slot.)</font>

1248
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:46,820
<font size="64">- Which one should we choose? - Don't reveal it just yet.</font>

1249
00:29:46,820 --> 00:29:48,360
<font size="64">- Jae Seok, there are two. - We should go to both.</font>

1250
00:29:47,290 --> 00:29:50,560
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(2 restaurants for those who are hungry)</font>

1251
00:29:48,360 --> 00:29:49,490
<font size="64">There are two restaurants.</font>

1252
00:29:49,490 --> 00:29:50,630
<font size="64">- Right. - One at the bottom.</font>

1253
00:29:50,630 --> 00:29:51,830
<font size="64">- That's right. - This one.</font>

1254
00:29:51,830 --> 00:29:53,630
<font size="64">Let's go with this one. One ondol room.</font>

1255
00:29:52,700 --> 00:29:55,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He chooses a restaurant with an ondol room.)</font>

1256
00:29:53,630 --> 00:29:56,300
<font size="64">We can all sleep on the ondol floor.</font>

1257
00:29:56,300 --> 00:29:59,600
<font size="64">- Hold on. Let's do this. - It's a good room for us all.</font>

1258
00:29:59,700 --> 00:30:01,700
<font size="64">- What are you doing? - Like this.</font>

1259
00:30:01,570 --> 00:30:03,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A "success" sticker is placed.)</font>

1260
00:30:01,800 --> 00:30:03,340
<font size="64">- It shows our success. - Nice.</font>

1261
00:30:03,340 --> 00:30:04,570
<font size="64">- Right? - You’re really good.</font>

1262
00:30:04,570 --> 00:30:06,240
<font size="64">- We should make that clear. - Are you a staff member?</font>

1263
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:07,810
<font size="64">- Are you a staff member? - I was picking up the slack.</font>

1264
00:30:07,810 --> 00:30:09,780
<font size="64">- I see. - Nice work, Kyung Hwan.</font>

1265
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:10,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A worker who finds things to do on his own)</font>

1266
00:30:09,780 --> 00:30:10,780
<font size="64">- There. - If we fail...</font>

1267
00:30:10,780 --> 00:30:13,420
<font size="64">If I had known, I would've made sure we failed.</font>

1268
00:30:13,350 --> 00:30:16,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Worked up)</font>

1269
00:30:13,420 --> 00:30:15,720
<font size="64">- I'm going to run wild now. - Exactly.</font>

1270
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:17,550
<font size="64">- Seok Sam, hold on. - What?</font>

1271
00:30:17,550 --> 00:30:20,190
<font size="64">How can you want to ruin us when the game's not over yet?</font>

1272
00:30:20,190 --> 00:30:22,330
<font size="64">- Put yourself in my shoes. - Are you a villain?</font>

1273
00:30:22,330 --> 00:30:24,460
<font size="64">Just imagine your face being up here instead.</font>

1274
00:30:24,460 --> 00:30:26,360
<font size="64">What if it was your face up here?</font>

1275
00:30:26,360 --> 00:30:27,430
<font size="64">Are you playing the villain?</font>

1276
00:30:27,430 --> 00:30:31,430
<font size="64">Who'd want to continue with filming today?</font>

1277
00:30:27,730 --> 00:30:29,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Annoyed)</font>

1278
00:30:30,030 --> 00:30:34,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's freaking out because he's been chosen for the penalty for now.)</font>

1279
00:30:31,430 --> 00:30:33,800
<font size="64">- He's not wrong. - I'll get the penalty for sure.</font>

1280
00:30:33,800 --> 00:30:37,410
<font size="64">If we get injured while playing today,</font>

1281
00:30:37,540 --> 00:30:39,810
<font size="64">don't we get automatically excluded?</font>

1282
00:30:39,810 --> 00:30:41,080
<font size="64">- He'll be like a free agent. - It's like...</font>

1283
00:30:41,080 --> 00:30:42,610
<font size="64">- Right? Yes? - Jong Kook.</font>

1284
00:30:42,610 --> 00:30:44,580
<font size="64">Are you thinking of snapping the leg of a swallow?</font>

1285
00:30:44,780 --> 00:30:46,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chills)</font>

1286
00:30:44,810 --> 00:30:46,980
<font size="64">- Like that? - If he were injured...</font>

1287
00:30:47,050 --> 00:30:48,720
<font size="64">I won't get injured.</font>

1288
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:50,520
<font size="64">I won't get injured, you punk.</font>

1289
00:30:49,220 --> 00:30:51,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Elbow jab)</font>

1290
00:30:50,520 --> 00:30:51,850
<font size="64">- Is this allowed? - I won't get injured.</font>

1291
00:30:51,820 --> 00:30:53,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Elbowing the cheekbone)</font>

1292
00:30:51,850 --> 00:30:53,290
<font size="64">You punk.</font>

1293
00:30:53,290 --> 00:30:54,620
<font size="64">- He hit me, but it was so soft. - I mean...</font>

1294
00:30:54,620 --> 00:30:56,030
<font size="64">Why did no one grab me?</font>

1295
00:30:56,030 --> 00:30:57,390
<font size="64">Why is your elbow so soft?</font>

1296
00:30:58,700 --> 00:31:02,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They head to the next location with the grumbling swallow.)</font>

1297
00:30:58,800 --> 00:31:00,230
<font size="64">- Unbelievable. - We should get going.</font>

1298
00:31:00,230 --> 00:31:01,300
<font size="64">- We should get going for now. - Should we move out?</font>

1299
00:31:01,300 --> 00:31:03,200
<font size="64">- Let's go. - Let's go!</font>

1300
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:04,530
<font size="64">Haha, the concert was so much fun.</font>

1301
00:31:04,530 --> 00:31:05,540
<font size="64">I had a blast.</font>

1302
00:31:05,540 --> 00:31:07,600
<font size="64">- I loved the guest performers. - Ddochi, we could also...</font>

1303
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:09,070
<font size="64">hold a concert.</font>

1304
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:12,040
<font size="64">Ye Eun will be an asset. She can even play the piano.</font>

1305
00:31:10,910 --> 00:31:13,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ye Eun used to played the piano for the church service.)</font>

1306
00:31:12,040 --> 00:31:13,910
<font size="64">- Yes, I can play it well. - You're right.</font>

1307
00:31:13,910 --> 00:31:15,610
<font size="64">- What about us? - Ji Hyo, why don't we do something?</font>

1308
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:17,780
<font size="64">How about we go live and have some drinks?</font>

1309
00:31:17,780 --> 00:31:19,420
<font size="64">- Drinks? - He's booking everyone he knows.</font>

1310
00:31:19,420 --> 00:31:21,250
<font size="64">He's looking for guests rather than doing it on his own.</font>

1311
00:31:19,620 --> 00:31:21,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A solo artist who isn't confident performing alone)</font>

1312
00:31:21,250 --> 00:31:23,350
<font size="64">Why do you always need someone to join you?</font>

1313
00:31:21,620 --> 00:31:23,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Persistent)</font>

1314
00:31:23,350 --> 00:31:26,160
<font size="64">- It should be "Haha and Friends." - Haha, stop harassing...</font>

1315
00:31:23,950 --> 00:31:26,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The title of the concert)</font>

1316
00:31:26,160 --> 00:31:27,520
<font size="64">Sang Guk and Young Jin.</font>

1317
00:31:27,520 --> 00:31:29,430
<font size="64">- How am I harassing them? - They're not good at dancing,</font>

1318
00:31:29,430 --> 00:31:31,130
<font size="64">but you bring them along so you can look good.</font>

1319
00:31:31,160 --> 00:31:34,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He dragged the people with no energy on stage.)</font>

1320
00:31:31,260 --> 00:31:32,730
<font size="64">You set two poor dancers beside you.</font>

1321
00:31:32,730 --> 00:31:34,830
<font size="64">- You saw them work hard, right? - It's just to make him look good.</font>

1322
00:31:34,830 --> 00:31:36,900
<font size="64">They were so intimidated because Jae Seok would be there too.</font>

1323
00:31:36,900 --> 00:31:38,840
<font size="64">- Were they intimidated? - Totally.</font>

1324
00:31:38,840 --> 00:31:40,540
<font size="64">Why are people intimidated by Jae Seok's presence?</font>

1325
00:31:40,540 --> 00:31:42,270
<font size="64">I just don't get it. Why?</font>

1326
00:31:42,270 --> 00:31:44,040
<font size="64">You're intimidated by him too.</font>

1327
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:45,480
<font size="64">What do you mean I'm intimidated?</font>

1328
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:47,080
<font size="64">You were shaking your legs when we were called in at 2am.</font>

1329
00:31:46,280 --> 00:31:47,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He told everyone to gather.)</font>

1330
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:48,110
<font size="64">No way.</font>

1331
00:31:48,110 --> 00:31:49,680
<font size="64">- Also... - What?</font>

1332
00:31:50,310 --> 00:31:52,180
<font size="64">- Can I talk? - You were shaking your legs.</font>

1333
00:31:52,420 --> 00:31:54,620
<font size="64">- No way. You've got it wrong. - Hold on.</font>

1334
00:31:53,350 --> 00:31:54,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tapping)</font>

1335
00:31:54,620 --> 00:31:56,120
<font size="64">- Kyung Hwan... - Stop poking me!</font>

1336
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:57,850
<font size="64">- Kyung Hwan's trying to talk. - Don't touch me.</font>

1337
00:31:57,850 --> 00:32:00,520
<font size="64">- Kyung Hwan's trying to talk. - Don't touch me.</font>

1338
00:31:58,490 --> 00:32:01,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Warning him without being able to look at him)</font>

1339
00:32:00,520 --> 00:32:02,290
<font size="64">Stop poking me.</font>

1340
00:32:02,460 --> 00:32:05,130
<font size="64">My eyes...</font>

1341
00:32:05,330 --> 00:32:07,330
<font size="64">- Look at him. - Don't touch my glasses. Don't.</font>

1342
00:32:05,530 --> 00:32:08,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Senior Yu freely puts his fingers in and out of his glasses.)</font>

1343
00:32:07,330 --> 00:32:08,730
<font size="64">- This is funny. - I might explode.</font>

1344
00:32:08,730 --> 00:32:10,470
<font size="64">- This is funny. - Don't touch them.</font>

1345
00:32:10,300 --> 00:32:15,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jeehuahua can't shake him off, so he's just shouting.)</font>

1346
00:32:10,470 --> 00:32:12,140
<font size="64">Don't pull on my ears.</font>

1347
00:32:12,140 --> 00:32:15,040
<font size="64">Don't touch my hat. Just don't.</font>

1348
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:17,840
<font size="64">- This is funny. - I've warned you.</font>

1349
00:32:15,510 --> 00:32:18,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He looks like a mess.)</font>

1350
00:32:17,910 --> 00:32:18,940
<font size="64">Just don't.</font>

1351
00:32:18,980 --> 00:32:20,180
<font size="64">Just don't.</font>

1352
00:32:19,580 --> 00:32:21,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ending with a weak warning)</font>

1353
00:32:20,880 --> 00:32:21,880
<font size="64">That was funny.</font>

1354
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:23,680
<font size="64">- Kyung Hwan was talking to you. - That's so funny.</font>

1355
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:26,550
<font size="64">Unbelievable. I need to teach him a lesson.</font>

1356
00:32:24,310 --> 00:32:26,320
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

1357
00:32:26,550 --> 00:32:29,220
<font size="64">Kyung Hwan hasn't been able to say a word. Are you okay?</font>

1358
00:32:29,890 --> 00:32:31,950
<font size="64">- Why would you address that? - I mean...</font>

1359
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:33,620
<font size="64">He hasn't been able to say anything. Are you good?</font>

1360
00:32:33,620 --> 00:32:35,430
<font size="64">He's not a professional, so...</font>

1361
00:32:35,430 --> 00:32:36,530
<font size="64">He falls somewhere between a pro and an amateur.</font>

1362
00:32:36,530 --> 00:32:38,490
<font size="64">That's why I'm here for a two-day event.</font>

1363
00:32:39,430 --> 00:32:41,430
<font size="64">- I have so much time left. - There's a lot of time left.</font>

1364
00:32:39,660 --> 00:32:41,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Relaxed)</font>

1365
00:32:41,430 --> 00:32:43,970
<font size="64">- Of course. - That's why you're not anxious.</font>

1366
00:32:41,430 --> 00:32:43,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He still has plenty of time before his deadline.)</font>

1367
00:32:43,970 --> 00:32:45,470
